{"term":"intensity","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:5548dc2100a091c636","definition":"The quality of being intense.","example":"“It is hard. And there is a level of viciousness that I was not expecting. I was not expecting the intensity of this experience, but this isn’t supposed to be easy. My father and this administration intends to be transformative, and we want to do big, bold things and we’re looking to change the status quo. So I didn’t expect it to be easy. I think some of the distractions and some of the ferocity was — I was a little blindsided by on a personal level,” she said.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["intension"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"countable, uncountable","wordFamily":["archaeointensity","high-intensity","high-intensity interval training","high intensity training","hyperintensity","hypointensity","immunointensity","isointensity","light intensity","luminous intensity","magnetic field intensity","Mercalli intensity","overintensity","palaeointensity","paleointensity","photointensity","serointensity","superintensity"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/intensity#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:8af1e52dfdfa7b4cd1","definition":"The degree of strength.","example":"The painting’s dislocated, unformed features are the very opposite of the hard, painted dolls of the other portrait, and, where they are dead and ready to topple, this unknown man’s eyes are full of intensity and life.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"countable, uncountable","wordFamily":["archaeointensity","high-intensity","high-intensity interval training","high intensity training","hyperintensity","hypointensity","immunointensity","isointensity","light intensity","luminous intensity","magnetic field intensity","Mercalli intensity","overintensity","palaeointensity","paleointensity","photointensity","sero